### `whoami`

```js
const me = {
    name: "Huỳnh Thìn",
    alias: "BreakTheBean",
    location: "Vietnam",
    role: "Developer / Student",

    interests: [
        "Minecraft",
        "Software development",
        "Game development",
        "Web design",
        "Open source"
    ],

    currently: "building things & learning new stuff",
    funFact: "I fix one bug and somehow create three more."
};
```

Not much of a bio person, tbh.

I enjoy turning random ideas into actual projects, experimenting with different technologies, and occasionally spending way too much time fixing a typo.

Still learning, still building, still breaking things.

